  States
DESCRIPTION:A living legend of American music\, Judy Collins returns to Be
 rkeley with a retrospective concert that looks back on her six-decade-long
  career and pays tribute to the generations of artists she has influenced.
  She has recorded 55 albums and\, as a testament to her impact on the musi
 c world\, artists such as Rufus Wainwright\, Shawn Colvin\, Dolly Parton\,
  and Leonard Cohen honored her legacy with the album Born to the Breed: A 
 Tribute to Judy Collins .\nCategory: Performing Arts\nOriginal listing: ht
